<view class="page qr-page">
  <view class="qr-head">
    <view>
      <view class="eyebrow">MEMBER QR</view>
      <view class="title">我的积分二维码</view>
    </view>
    <button class="icon-button" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}" bindtap="createQRCode">
      <text>↻</text>
    </button>
  </view>

  <view class="qr-card">
    <view wx:if="{{qr && !expired}}" class="qr-box">
      <image class="qr-image" src="{{qrImage}}" mode="aspectFit"></image>
    </view>
    <view wx:elif="{{expired}}" class="qr-empty qr-expired">二维码已过期</view>
    <view wx:elif="{{loading}}" class="qr-empty">生成中</view>
    <view wx:else class="qr-empty">暂无二维码</view>

    <view class="qr-copy">
      <view class="qr-title">给工作人员扫码</view>
      <view class="qr-desc">{{expiresText || '二维码短期有效'}}，过期后点击右上角刷新。</view>
    </view>

  </view>

  <view class="notice">
    这个二维码只用于现场工作人员核对并添加积分，不展示你的微信账号信息。
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view>
</view>
